    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9CUizqNaS4R--M2k-7VbC0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCTVdubHpMWFJvWjNCdVNURjJWUzA1UVV4WVpFRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Did not know that my neighborhood got a cute, cozy cafe?!! I ordered their coffee which turned out super gewd. (The matcha is worth another visit, I am so curious. ) butte croissant is noiceee better than the famous coffee shop’s. The dimsum is ok. Luv to go and sip another cup of coffee😙😙",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Did not know that my neighborhood got a cute, cozy cafe?!! I ordered their coffee which turned out super gewd. (The matcha is worth another visit, I am so curious. ) butte croissant is noiceee better than the famous coffee shop’s. The dimsum is ok. Luv to go and sip another cup of coffee😙😙",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
