      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCTVdubHpMWFJvWjNCdVNURjJWUzA1UVV4WVpFRRAB!2m1!1s0x2e698d3a8b94d05f:0x2d6cd5ee9336e3fb"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9CUizqNaS4R--M2k-7VbC0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGSk5teDBNWEJaWkhOYVQwTjFSelU0T1dSU1VHYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Simple, straightforward, coffee shop.\n\nThey are very well priced (if not underpriced) with a ton of options for manual brew. Tried their house blend as an americano as well and it was good.\n\nThe only thing I'd improve is for people to be able to see the menu from the indoor seating as all the outdoor seating are all smoking area, so it was a bit annoying for us to have to go outside to see the menu (and held our breath while at it) and then order from inside\n\nBut overall would recommend!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Simple, straightforward, coffee shop.\n\nThey are very well priced (if not underpriced) with a ton of options for manual brew. Tried their house blend as an americano as well and it was good.\n\nThe only thing I'd improve is for people to be able to see the menu from the indoor seating as all the outdoor seating are all smoking area, so it was a bit annoying for us to have to go outside to see the menu (and held our breath while at it) and then order from inside\n\nBut overall would recommend!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
