    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9CUizqNaS4R--M2k-7VbC0/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBNXZhdkVBEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Countless times coming here, the place is perfect for wfc!\n\nThe food and drink were good. I ordered coffee and i like it, they also offered plant based milk if you were lactose intolerance. My friend ordered peach tea and truffle fries. Fries were crispy!\n\nI also ordered dimsum with mentai sauce because it was their specialty. Although i can’t really taste the tobiko but overall it was umami.\n\nKinda a lil bit pricey for overall menu but looking at the interior well we knew where the money goes to.\n\nRecommended for wfc!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Countless times coming here, the place is perfect for wfc!\n\nThe food and drink were good. I ordered coffee and i like it, they also offered plant based milk if you were lactose intolerance. My friend ordered peach tea and truffle fries. Fries were crispy!\n\nI also ordered dimsum with mentai sauce because it was their specialty. Although i can’t really taste the tobiko but overall it was umami.\n\nKinda a lil bit pricey for overall menu but looking at the interior well we knew where the money goes to.\n\nRecommended for wfc!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
