    {
      "name": "places/ChIJX9CUizqNaS4R--M2k-7VbC0/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOeU1IaVdBEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "No doubt the coffee is soooo gewd and so the croissant.\n\nCroissant crunchy outside but soft inside. Smells really good and similar with popular & luxury pastry shop in the city\n\nThe coffee is way more stronger if you don't put any sugar in it. I love their coffee. They've unique flavors like charcoal. Need to try and worth to try!!\n\nThe location is quite hidden gem i guess but it's so close to my home so it's my best encounter on 2023",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
